# 🚀 Implementation Phases

## Phase 1: Soft Launch (Digital Only)
**Scope:**  
Introduce slot booking interfaces and digital token rewards.  

**Dependency:**  
Utilizes existing service counters with zero physical hardware dependencies.  

**Key KPI:**  
Passenger adoption rate of incentivized early slots.  

---

## Phase 2: Operational Hardening (Infrastructure)
**Scope:**  
Deploy physical Smart Cradles and automated enforcement barriers at designated express lanes.  

**Dependency:**  
Integration of real-time weight sensors with the token verification layer.  

**Key KPI:**  
Reduction in per-passenger processing time within express channels.  

---

## Phase 3: Ecosystem Integration (Full Scale)
**Scope:**  
Enable AI-driven dynamic disruption management (e.g., automated retail vouchers during tactical delays) and cross-industry loyalty engine synergy.  

**Dependency:**  
API exposure to participating airport commercial retailers.  

**Key KPI:**  
Increase in airport retail non-aeronautical revenue ("Found Time" optimization).  

